# Keep the Docker build context small. The multi-stage Dockerfile builds the
# host binary and every plugins/* .so from source inside the builder stage,
# so the context only needs the repo itself — no prebuilt artifacts. The
# release workflow no longer stages ./huan or ./docker-plugins into the
# context (removed in the multi-stage rework).
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd
!internal
!pkg
!plugins
!scripts
!web
